                                "example_id": "66ec2152-cc80-4ea0-b50c-669fa07cbdbd",
                                "sense_id": "18c7ab2b-a725-3742-b9ea-7ab86f5515e7",
                                "text": "Ng blows out more smoke, thinking. \"As we learned in Vietnam, high-powered weapons are so sensorily overwhelming that they are similar to pyschoactive drugs."
